{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019QTaJ1ARLwajaABQy8Pg83","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Plan: build the approved spec\n2\t\n3\tMade in plan mode from `work/spec.md`. Claude Code read the code, then wrote this plan. No file changed until it was approved.\n4\t\n5\t## Files that change\n6\t\n7\t- `src/wrenches.ts`\n8\t- `src/crew-queue.ts`\n9\t- `src/database.ts`\n10\t\n11\t## Order of work\n12\t\n13\t- **P-1** Disable the bike when a wrench arrives, in `src/wrenches.ts`. Serves AC-1 and AC-2.\n14\t- **P-2** Start the deadline clock at the wrench `reported_at`, in `src/crew-queue.ts`. Serves AC-4.\n15\t- **P-3** Sort the queue by deadline, due first, in `src/crew-queue.ts`. Serves AC-3.\n16\t\n17\t## Risks\n18\t\n19\t- P-1 is the riskiest step: if the update fails, the bike stays rentable. The acceptance test for AC-1 catches it.\n20\t- Sorting must not drop jobs. AC-3 checks the order on all open jobs.\n21\t\n22\t## Proof\n23\t\n24\t- `bun test` passes, including `test/acceptance/`.\n25\t- `bun run world`, then `bun run world wrench B-2207` shows `is_disabled: true`.\n26\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CCPeEj4kziQq3XmRdFXL9G","agent_id":"aa975737ae9885ba7","session_id":"2224f79c-2ab4-4cc9-a55e-515fbe1ee521","uuid":"00bedef3-a437-43de-9cc3-06d98e2c6782","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:23:17.001Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019QTaJ1ARLwajaABQy8Pg83","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"reviewer","task_description":"Review local-deadlines branch"}
